    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase 5 prompt engineering rewrite engine release-gate benchmarks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides reproducible latency and throughput measurements for the rewrite engine hot paths identified in the prompt engineering module roadmap (Phase 5 — Performance and Hardening). Results are used as release gates; a regression beyond 10% vs. the baseline blocks promotion.</para>
<sect2 id="bench__rewrite__engine_8cpp_1autotoc_md6">
<title>Benchmark families</title>
<para><heading level="3">PEG-01..03 — RewriteEngine execution hot paths</heading>
</para>
<para>PEG-01 RewriteEngine::execute() with normalization phase (single pass) PEG-02 RewriteEngine::execute() with policy phase (multi-rule) PEG-03 RewriteEngine::execute() with NL→AQL phase (semantic rewrite)</para>
<para><heading level="3">PEG-04..05 — Rule loading and compilation</heading>
</para>
<para>PEG-04 RewriteRuleLoader::loadFromYAML (100-rule config) PEG-05 RewriteEngine trace generation and audit (100 events)</para>
<para><heading level="3">PEG-06 — Adversarial hardening</heading>
</para>
<para>PEG-06 RewriteEngine step limit enforcement (max_steps boundary)</para>
</sect2>
<sect2 id="bench__rewrite__engine_8cpp_1autotoc_md7">
<title>Hard release gates</title>
<para><table rows="7" cols="3"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Gate ID   </para>
