</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
<para>All benchmarks:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Use kPegCanonicalSeed = 42 for deterministic synthetic data.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Run with Repetitions(kRepetitions) to capture variance.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>I/O-bound registrations use UseRealTime().</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
